        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 71870,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mari pelajari konsep baru yang menjelaskan cara variabel melacak hal-hal seperti menambahkan atau mengurangi dolar dari dompet.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   button {&#xA;    background-color: darkBlue;&#xA;    /* Green */&#xA;    border: none;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    text-decoration: none;&#xA;    display: inline-block;&#xA;    font-size: 14px;&#xA;    padding: 6px 12px;&#xA;    margin: 0 12px 0 0;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Wallet: &lt;strong&gt;$&lt;span id=&quot;amount&quot;&gt;15&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;add()&quot;&gt;Add $1&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;remove()&quot;&gt;Remove $1&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let wallet = 15;&#xA;   let amountCounter = document.getElementById('amount');&#xA;   &#xA;   function add() {&#xA;    wallet += 1;&#xA;    amountCounter.innerHTML = wallet;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   function remove() {&#xA;    wallet -= 1;&#xA;    amountCounter.innerHTML = wallet;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Assigning a value",
            "id": 71871,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat membuat variabel, kita <strong>menetapkan</strong> sebuah nilai ke variabel tersebut, seperti menetapkan <code>3</code> ke <code>wallet</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(wallet);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat membuat variabel, kita <strong>menetapkan</strong> nilai padanya, seperti <code>3</code> ke <code>wallet</code>. Lengkapi deklarasi agar konsol menampilkan <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(wallet);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"speed\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>wallet</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Self-assigning a value",
            "id": 71872,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Self-assignment</strong> adalah saat kita menetapkan sebuah variabel ke nilainya sendiri. Misalnya, kita dapat menetapkan <code>wallet</code> ke nilainya, yaitu <code>3</code>, dengan <code>wallet = wallet</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(wallet);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>wallet</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, lalu <code>wallet</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tulis <code>wallet = wallet</code> agar nilai <code>3</code> tidak berubah. Ini disebut <strong>self-assignment</strong>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(wallet);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+ 1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>wallet</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, <code>wallet</code>, dan terakhir <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Incrementing numbers",
            "id": 71873,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Karena kita dapat menetapkan variabel ke variabel itu sendiri, kita dapat menambah atau mengurangi variabel yang nilainya berupa angka. Coba tambahkan <code>wallet</code> dengan <code>wallet = wallet + 1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(wallet);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3 + 1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>wallet + 1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gunakan <code>wallet = wallet + 1</code> untuk menaikkan nilainya. Lengkapi pembaruan agar konsol menampilkan <code>4</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(wallet);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>wallet</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, <code>wallet</code>, <code>+</code>, dan terakhir <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Why self-assigning matters",
            "id": 71881,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel yang ditetapkan ke dirinya sendiri memungkinkan kita melacak data yang berubah seiring waktu. Misalnya, pengguna bisa menambahkan <code>2</code> dolar ke dompet, lalu mengurangi <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet + \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(wallet);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>2</code>, diikuti oleh <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan <code>2</code> dolar ke dompet, lalu kurangi <code>1</code>. Lengkapi kedua pembaruan agar konsol menampilkan <code>4</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet + \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(wallet);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>+</code>, diikuti oleh <code>2</code>, <code>-</code>, dan terakhir <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Self-assigning strings",
            "id": 71874,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel yang diatur ke string bekerja dengan cara yang sama. Coba atur <code>nameInfo</code> menjadi <code>nameInfo + \" John\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" nameInfo = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Account name:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"nameInfo = nameInfo + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Elton&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"nameInfo = nameInfo + \" /><text value=\"&quot; John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(nameInfo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"83\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Account name: Elton John\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>nameInfo</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Assigning a value",
            "id": 72116,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa nilai yang ditetapkan ke variabel <code>speed</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" speed = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>speed</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah deklarasi ini dijalankan, nilai apa yang disimpan dalam <code>speed</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" speed = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>speed</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada nilai karena <code>const</code> hanya memberinya nama.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Self-assigning a value",
            "id": 72117,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" speed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed = speed;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(speed);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"100\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>100</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assignment menggunakan <code>speed</code> di kedua sisi. Apa yang ditampilkan konsol setelahnya?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" speed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed = speed;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(speed);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"100\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>100</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>speed</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing numbers",
            "id": 72118,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" speed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed = speed + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(speed);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"101\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>101</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>101</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebelum baris kedua, <code>speed</code> bernilai <code>100</code>. Nilai apa yang masuk ke konsol setelah baris itu dijalankan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" speed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed = speed + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(speed);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"101\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>101</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>101</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Why self-assigning matters",
            "id": 72119,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa menetapkan nilai ke diri sendiri merupakan konsep pemrograman yang begitu kuat?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Karena memungkinkan kita melacak data yang berubah seiring waktu</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Karena membantu kita membuat perbandingan</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Karena memungkinkan kita melacak data yang berubah seiring waktu.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Total dompet berubah setiap kali seseorang menambah atau membelanjakan uang. Mengapa self-assignment cocok untuk situasi ini?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Karena memungkinkan kita melacak data yang berubah seiring waktu</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Karena membantu kita membuat perbandingan</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Karena ini mencegah variabel berubah.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Karena memungkinkan kita melacak data yang berubah seiring waktu.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Self-assigning strings",
            "id": 72120,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fullName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jane&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"fullName = fullName + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Bowling&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fullName);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Jane Bowling\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Jane Bowling</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Bowling Jane</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Jane Bowling</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assignment kedua menambahkan teks ke value <code>fullName</code> saat ini dan menyimpan hasilnya kembali dalam <code>fullName</code>.</p><p>Jika assignment tersebut berjalan dua kali sebelum <code>console.log</code>, apa yang ditampilkan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fullName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jane&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"fullName = fullName + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Bowling&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fullName);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Jane Bowling\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Jane Bowling Bowling</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Jane Bowling</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Bowling Jane</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Jane Bowling Bowling.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Assigning a value",
            "id": 72122,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berikan nilai <code>15</code> ke variabel <code>wallet</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wallet = \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>15</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat konstanta <code>wallet</code> agar menyimpan <code>15</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wallet = \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"speed\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>wallet</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>15</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Self-assigning a value",
            "id": 72123,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berikan nilai pada <code>likes</code> sehingga <code>5</code> ditampilkan di konsol.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likes = number;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(likes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>number</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat <code>likes</code> dengan menetapkan variabel <code>number</code> kepadanya. Gunakan nama variabel, bukan number literal.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likes = number;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(likes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>likes</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>number</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
