            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan lima ke nilai variabel <code>inventory</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"inventory = inventory + \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"16\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>inventory + 5</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk memperbarui angka, gunakan value saat ini dalam perhitungan dan tetapkan kembali hasilnya ke variabel yang sama.</p><p>Naikkan <code>inventory</code> sebesar <code>5</code> menggunakan value saat ini.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"inventory = inventory + \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"inventory - 5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"inventory + 4\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"16\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>inventory</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>inventory + 5</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
